Poids: 12
Facteur de vitesse: 9
Type de compétence : Great Swords
Type: arme à 2 mains
~
@302  = ~Everhate Vorpal Sword~
@303  = ~The Everhate Vorpal Sword radiates a dark aura when you examine it, and the blade is so finely sharpened it could likely sever a head in a single blow. Upon getting close to the weapon you can feel the evil aura emanating from it. It repels anyone who is not evil from it.

PARAMETRES:

Combat Capacités:
 25% chance each hit that target must make a jet de sauvegarde vs death (-2 Pénalité) or die.

