Poids: 0
Launcher: Bow
~
@312  = ~Axe of the Defender +4~
@313  = ~A fine weapon the Axe of the Defender has served only a few masters, probably because the fine weapon protected them. It was in the possession of Clan Stonebridge until betrayal from within to a band of Orcs who invaded Clan Stonebridge's Keep. All the dwarves were killed and what happened with this axe has been a mystery.

